{"script":"sj_050_02","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_2"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara050_1","mirrow":false,"x":170,"trans":false,"y":-171,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara050_1_face_chara050_1h","noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"alpha":1,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara050_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":0,"x":170,"trans":false,"y":-171,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"timeBak":300,"addImg":"chara050_1_face_chara050_1h","nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米拉贝尔","text":"[show]舒服过头了！舒服得我都差点忘了还有自卫团的事情要处理了！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara050_1_face_chara050_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米拉贝尔","text":"[show]要不是皮塔特地跑来叫我，我都忘了村子里还要开会的事……[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米拉贝尔","text":"[show]好不容易跑回去开完会，处理完工作，我没呆两天就又跑回来了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米拉贝尔","text":"[show]唉……要说条件的话，这里其实也没比巴诺姆村好到哪里去，但是能够远离那些烦心事，这一点是真的让人无法拒绝。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara050_1_face_chara050_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米拉贝尔","text":"[show]不过我也知道，总是逃避的话是不会有成长的。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara050_1_face_chara050_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米拉贝尔","text":"[show]所以……有空的话，能拜托你和我一起回巴诺姆村吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara050_1_face_chara050_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米拉贝尔","text":"[show]虽然村子里的事情现在还是千头万绪一团乱麻，但只要有你在我身后，我就感觉无所不能了。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"米拉贝尔","text":"[show]之前可是你让我站出来带领大家的！你可要好好负起责任来呀！[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"alpha":0,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","img":"chara050_1","mirrow":false,"transTime":0,"x":170,"trans":false,"y":-171,"noOut":false,"scaleX":1,"timeBak":300,"addImg":"chara050_1_face_chara050_1a","nonStandBright":false,"noIn":false,"scaleY":1},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"米拉贝尔-在这里住的还舒服吗？"}